# Linear Workflow

- This repository is associated with the Linear project: `Talvio`.
- project id is "1483a14a626b"
- When creating or updating Linear issues for this repository, use that project.
- Preserve the existing team, project, labels, priority, and workflow conventions.
- Before creating a new issue, search Linear for duplicates.
- Include a concise title, relevant context, acceptance criteria, and implementation notes.
- Do not create or modify Linear issues unless explicitly requested by the user, but update status if your work results in status change of the issue.
- For planning (Notion first, then Linear issues), use `/plan`. Do not implement unless explicitly asked.
- For reviewing a plan or Linear issue without implementing, use `/review-plan`.
- For ticket implementation workflow (status, comments, PR handoff, Notion updates), use `/start-issue`.
- If the project name is ambiguous or unavailable, ask before creating an issue.
